+This block writes small `runbooks-demo-tool` and `runbooks-demo-glab` scripts to `bin/` in the working directory, and writes a `PATH` with that directory on it to `$RUNBOOK_ENV`, for the blocks that name this one in `envFrom`. Run it, then click **Check** above: the check finds both. One tool of the `anyOf` list is enough, so `runbooks-demo-gh` isn't needed. Set `DEMO_TOOL_VERSION` before you start the app to install another version of `runbooks-demo-tool`.
 
